flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1230110Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1230876Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1231334Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1231753Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1233158Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1233700Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1234057Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1234782Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1235153Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1235758Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1236429Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1237330Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1237793Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1237998Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1238293Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
