flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1238951Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1239442Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1239619Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1239751Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1239979Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1243828Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
