flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1248931Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T13:58:11.1249276Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
